param=param_1293,63
param=param_1268,3506
param=param_1267,60
param=param_1274,You are now on a quest to deal with the dragon. For more information, click on the Quest List tab on the side bar...
param=param_1275,...and then on the Unstable Foundations entry to view your Quest Journal.
