// 1710
[struct_1710]
param=param_1266,Check your World Map
param=param_1273,Before you go off to drug the dragon, check your surroundings. The minimap in the top-right of the screen gives a general picture; for more detail, open the world map by clicking on the globe icon.
param=param_1292,Completing this Task will help you escape from the cellar in which you find yourself.
param=param_1271,"task_tutorial_icons2,1"
param=param_1293,63
param=param_1268,3508
param=param_1267,60
param=param_1274,Check the minimap in the top-right corner of the screen to see a plan of the cellar.
param=param_1275,For a more complete picture of the area, click on the globe button next to the minimap.
param=param_1276,The world map will show you many other places once you are free of this cellar.
param=param_1269,3509
param=param_1290,1
param=param_1322,1

// 1711
[struct_1711]
param=param_1266,Realign your Minimap
param=param_1273,Set your camera view and minimap alignment back to face North, by clicking on the compass icon next to your minimap.
