// 2765
[struct_2765]
param=param_2095,Dagannoth Sentinels
param=param_2096,10
param=param_2153,npc_14467
param=param_2154,npc_14467
param=param_2168,npc_14468
param=param_2169,npc_14468
param=param_2123,37
param=param_2124,32
param=param_2125,37
param=param_2126,29
param=param_2097,2
param=param_2184,These chaps are so identical they must be closely related! They are of the race of sea creatures that cause havoc for the Fremennik.<br><br><col=F5B241>Quest</col>: Blood Runs Deep<br><br><col=F5B241>Combat</col>: These bad boys work as a fearsome pair. They will restore each other's health if you concentrate on one for too long. They attack with a mixture of melee, magic and ranged.
param=param_2102,Grrr
param=param_2103,Rawr
param=param_2118,vorbis_8367
param=param_2119,vorbis_8367
param=param_2120,vorbis_8367
param=param_2121,vorbis_8367
param=param_2122,5000
param=param_2099,0
param=param_2101,aif_dom_dagannoth_sentinels

// 2766
[struct_2766]
param=param_2095,Karamel and Gelatinnoth Mother
param=param_2096,11
param=param_2153,npc_14456
param=param_2154,npc_14475
param=param_2168,npc_14457
param=param_2169,npc_14476
param=param_2123,38
param=param_2124,30
param=param_2125,37
param=param_2126,31
param=param_2097,2
param=param_2184,These two creatures are creations of the Culinaromancer. One's a karamel treat, the other a jelly, so if a warrior is not hungry before fighting them, they may be afterwards.<br><br><col=F5B241>Quest</col>: Recipe for Disaster<br><br><col=F5B241>Combat</col>: Karamel will attack you with melee and mage attacks, reacting to the protection prayers you have active. She will also freeze you occasionally. The gelatinnoth mother works much like dagannoths, switching between the following states for you to attack by: blue (water magic); orange (melee attacks); green (ranged attacks); brown (earth magic); red (fire magic); white (air magic). She uses ranged attacks. Tasty.<br><br>If you don't have the normal spellbook active, it will become active when you start this battle, and will revert afterwards.
param=param_2102,Well hello, sweetie.
param=param_2103,Graaar
param=param_2118,vorbis_8026
param=param_2119,vorbis_8026
param=param_2120,vorbis_8026
param=param_2121,vorbis_8026
param=param_2122,4800
param=param_2099,0
param=param_2101,aif_dom_karamel_gelatinnoth

// 2767
[struct_2767]
param=param_2095,Nezikchened
param=param_2096,12
param=param_2153,npc_14519
param=param_2168,npc_14520
param=param_2123,37
param=param_2124,31
param=param_2097,1
param=param_2184,An enormous black demon, a creature of the underworld and altogether evil being. If he doesn't slash his enemies to pieces with his claws, they're likely to succumb to his vicious magic.<br><br><col=F5B241>Quest</col>: Legend's Quest<br><br><col=F5B241>Combat</col>: The huge black demon will attack with magic unless you run in and attack close range, at which he will switch to attack with his claws.
param=param_2102,Graaarrr!
param=param_2118,vorbis_4428
param=param_2119,vorbis_4428
param=param_2120,vorbis_4428
param=param_2121,vorbis_4428
param=param_2122,1500
param=param_2099,0
param=param_2101,graphic_8239

// 2768
[struct_2768]
param=param_2095,Balance Elemental
param=param_2096,13
param=param_2153,npc_14462
param=param_2168,npc_14466
param=param_2123,36
param=param_2124,30
param=param_2097,4
param=param_2184,This amorphous being is one of Guthix's guardians set to protect the Stone of Jas. He is unlike any creature in the world since he is able to alter his own body into shapes, calling upon worldly elements to perform deadly attacks.<br><br><col=F5B241>Quest</col>: While Guthix Sleeps<br><br><col=F5B241>Combat</col>: He's wise to prayer types, so prepare your attacks carefully. He attacks with melee, ranged and mage attacks.
param=param_2102,I'm going to annihilate you.
param=param_2118,vorbis_2901
param=param_2119,vorbis_2901
param=param_2120,vorbis_2901
param=param_2121,vorbis_2901
param=param_2122,2750
param=param_2099,0
param=param_2101,aif_dom_balance_elemental
param=param_2183,npc_14463

// 2769
[struct_2769]
param=param_2095,Jungle Demon
param=param_2096,14
param=param_2153,npc_14590
param=param_2168,npc_14591
param=param_2123,37
param=param_2124,30
param=param_2097,1
param=param_2184,This big, lean, green killing machine is hardly friendly. Like all demons this one exists to slice its enemies to pieces with its claws or damage them with its magic powers.<br><br><col=F5B241>Quest</col>: Monkey Madness<br><br><col=F5B241>Combat</col>: The demon attacks with a mixture of melee and magic and will alter its attacks based on any protection prayers you use. There are no gnomes to help you out this time!
param=param_2102,Rarrrr
param=param_2118,vorbis_4454
param=param_2119,vorbis_4454
param=param_2120,vorbis_4454
param=param_2121,vorbis_4454
param=param_2122,1700
param=param_2099,0
param=param_2101,graphic_8241

// 2770
[struct_2770]
param=param_2095,Arrav
param=param_2096,15
param=param_2153,npc_14433
param=param_2168,npc_14434
param=param_2123,38
param=param_2124,32
param=param_2097,3
param=param_2184,A man with a deep history, he lived many years ago in the fourth age. He was pivotal in the defence of Varrock against a zombie invasion summoned by the Mahjarrat Zemouregal. How can someone bring themselves to kill him?<br><br><col=F5B241>Quest</col>: Curse of Arrav<br><br><col=F5B241>Combat</col>: Arrav will heal himself twice before he dies and, unlike during your first encounter with him, in the tower this image of him will most certainly die. He attacks with his sword and basic melee.
param=param_2102,Foolish! You'll never defeat me!
param=param_2118,vorbis_8632
param=param_2119,vorbis_8632
param=param_2120,vorbis_8632
param=param_2121,vorbis_8632
param=param_2122,1800
param=param_2099,0
param=param_2101,aif_dom_arrav

// 2771
[struct_2771]
param=param_2095,Ice Demon
param=param_2096,16
param=param_2153,npc_14545
param=param_2168,npc_14546
param=param_2123,37
param=param_2124,31
param=param_2097,3
param=param_2184,This frosty fellow is making a return from the frozen fortress of Ghorrock to remind warriors of his icy grip.<br><br><col=F5B241>Quest</col>: The Temple at Senntisten<br><br><col=F5B241>Combat</col>: This chilly demon fights with ranged and magic attacks. He also will occasionally freeze you. Might require some careful use of the protection prayers, assuming you have them available to you!
param=param_2102,Grrrr
param=param_2118,vorbis_4452
param=param_2119,vorbis_4452
param=param_2120,vorbis_4452
param=param_2121,vorbis_4452
param=param_2122,1500
param=param_2099,0
param=param_2101,aif_dom_ice_demon

// 2772
[struct_2772]
param=param_2095,The Inadequacy (+ Doubts)
param=param_2096,17
param=param_2153,npc_14538
param=param_2168,npc_14539
param=param_2123,35
param=param_2124,29
param=param_2097,2
param=param_2184,Does this beast really exist? Only in our imaginations! The writhing blob with eyes feeds on people's insecurities and hits them with doubts.<br><br><col=F5B241>Quest</col>: Dream Mentor<br><br><col=F5B241>Combat</col>: The Inadequacy has aggressive ranged and melee attacks but also spawns doubts to deal you extra damage. At least Cyrisus is there to help a little.
param=param_2102,Squelch
param=param_2118,vorbis_2901
param=param_2119,vorbis_2901
param=param_2120,vorbis_2901
param=param_2121,vorbis_2901
param=param_2122,1800
