// 2773
[struct_2773]
param=param_2095,Giant Roc
param=param_2096,18
param=param_2153,npc_14460
param=param_2168,npc_14461
param=param_2123,36
param=param_2124,29
param=param_2097,1
param=param_2184,Now that's a very big blue bird! It's swift and deadly and attacks from above unlike most other creatures likely to be found in Gielinor.<br><br><col=F5B241>Quest</col>: My Arm's Big Adventure<br><br><col=F5B241>Combat</col>: This bird of epic proportions will use several types of attack. Occasionally it will knock you back, stunning you. It pecks at your eyes with its melee attack and throws boulders to deal ranged damage.
param=param_2102,Nraaa
param=param_2118,vorbis_8169
param=param_2119,vorbis_8169
param=param_2120,vorbis_8169
param=param_2121,vorbis_8169
param=param_2122,2500
param=param_2099,0
param=param_2101,aif_dom_giant_roc

// 2774
[struct_2774]
param=param_2095,Arrg
param=param_2096,19
param=param_2153,npc_14452
param=param_2168,npc_14453
param=param_2123,37
param=param_2124,31
param=param_2097,1
param=param_2184,Arrg is a giant troll, named after the sound made by the first thing he ate. Arrg won't hesitate to smash his victims' bones to dust with his hammer so anyone approaching should be quick on their feet.<br><br><col=F5B241>Quest</col>: Troll Romance<br><br><col=F5B241>Combat</col>: Oh no, it's the beastly Arrg! He'll attack you with a mixture of melee and ranged as he hurls rocks into your face! Bam!
param=param_2102,Kill silly human
param=param_2118,vorbis_8052
param=param_2119,vorbis_8052
param=param_2120,vorbis_8052
param=param_2121,vorbis_8052
param=param_2122,1400
param=param_2099,0
param=param_2101,aif_dom_arrg

// 2775
[struct_2775]
param=param_2095,Barrelchest (version 1)
param=param_2096,20
param=param_2153,npc_14513
param=param_2168,npc_14514
param=param_2123,37
param=param_2124,30
param=param_2097,1
param=param_2184,This monstrosity is a clever machine made from various nautical objects by Mi-Gor the undead surgeon pirate. No, really...<br><br><col=F5B241>Quest</col>: The Great Brain Robbery<br><br><col=F5B241>Combat</col>: This weird contraption will perform melee damage, but also reduces your Defence, Attack, Ranged and Magic stats if you don't have high enough crush defence. He will also reduce your prayer points and turn off any active prayers.
param=param_2102,You my friend are about to die.
param=param_2118,vorbis_8043
param=param_2119,vorbis_8043
