// 2778
[struct_2778]
param=param_2095,Flambeed, Agrith-Na-Na and Dessourt
param=param_2096,23
param=param_2153,npc_14437
param=param_2154,npc_14543
param=param_2155,npc_14424
param=param_2168,npc_14438
param=param_2169,npc_14544
param=param_2170,npc_14425
param=param_2123,35
param=param_2124,31
param=param_2125,37
param=param_2126,28
param=param_2127,36
param=param_2128,30
param=param_2097,2
param=param_2184,These evil machinations of the Culinaromancer could only be created by someone obsessed with food. Three 'things' are made from loads of hot cakes, bananas and sweets. Beyond not dying, most people struggle not to take a sneaky bite of one of them.<br><br><col=F5B241>Quest</col>: Recipe for Disaster<br><br><col=F5B241>Combat</col>: A deadly trio. Flambeed is a fiery foe and you'll need to be wearing ice gloves when attacking to hold on to your weapons. He attacks with melee and magic. Agrith-Na-Na fights with magic and will occasionally teleport you face-to-face. Dessourt deals a mixture of melee, ranged and magic attacks and will occasionally teleport straight to you if you wander (or flee) too far away.
param=param_2102,Yummy!
param=param_2103,Let's eat him
param=param_2104,A tasty morsel
param=param_2118,vorbis_8639
param=param_2119,vorbis_8639
param=param_2120,vorbis_8639
param=param_2121,vorbis_8639
param=param_2122,5400
param=param_2099,0
param=param_2101,aif_dom_flambeed_agrith_dessourt

// 2779
[struct_2779]
param=param_2095,Giant Scarab
param=param_2096,24
param=param_2153,npc_14608
param=param_2168,npc_14609
param=param_2123,37
param=param_2124,31
param=param_2097,2
param=param_2184,It's giant. It's scaraby. What else does anyone need to know? If one looks closely enough they'll spy Kaleef's Keris dagger - a weapon crafted to destroy any one who should worship Scabaras.<br><br><col=F5B241>Quest</col>: Contact!<br><br><col=F5B241>Combat</col>: The scarab is a mighty foe by himself, but he'll also summon locust riders, mages and rangers to fight by his side. The giant scarab himself attacks with a mixture of melee and ranged while his helpers will set upon you with a mixture of all corners of the combat triangle. The giant scarab will also poison you if you're fighting from a distance.
param=param_2102,Rrrrr
param=param_2118,vorbis_4312
param=param_2119,vorbis_4312
param=param_2120,vorbis_4312
param=param_2121,vorbis_4312
param=param_2122,1300
param=param_2099,0
param=param_2101,aif_dom_scarab_riders

// 2780
[struct_2780]
param=param_2095,Bouncer
param=param_2096,25
param=param_2153,npc_14482
param=param_2168,npc_14483
param=param_2123,37
param=param_2124,31
param=param_2097,3
param=param_2184,The most brutal guard dog of all time. If his red eyes and horns wouldn't worry a burglar, not much else probably could!<br><br><col=F5B241>Quest</col>: Fight Arena<br><br><col=F5B241>Combat</col>: Woof! Attacks with melee combat, close range. You could get up close and kill him quickly, or stay a safe distance to conserve health.
param=param_2102,Grrr
param=param_2118,vorbis_4303
param=param_2119,vorbis_4303
param=param_2120,vorbis_4303
param=param_2121,vorbis_4303
param=param_2122,1160
param=param_2099,0
