param=param_2123,38
param=param_2124,32
param=param_2097,1
param=param_2184,The guardian of the rare dramen tree, the spirit exists as a guardian to the tree; wood of which is key for any wanting to travel to the plane of Zanaris.<br><br><col=F5B241>Quest</col>: Lost City<br><br><col=F5B241>Combat</col>: Now you can show the spirit how tough you are with more than an axe! (No, you can't hide behind mushrooms to make it easier).
param=param_2102,Be away with you mortal
