// 2796
[struct_2796]
param=param_2095,The Kendal
param=param_2096,41
param=param_2153,npc_14526
param=param_2168,npc_14527
param=param_2123,37
param=param_2124,31
param=param_2097,1
param=param_2184,Many have heard of the phrase 'a wolf in sheep's clothing'. However, this is a man in a bear costume.<br><br><col=F5B241>Quest</col>: Mountain Daughter<br><br><col=F5B241>Combat</col>: Grrrr! Still dressed in his stinky costume, he will attack you with melee combat, trying his best to slice you up with his claws.
param=param_2102,Die! *ahem* Roar!
param=param_2118,vorbis_7975
param=param_2119,vorbis_7975
param=param_2120,vorbis_7975
param=param_2121,vorbis_7975
param=param_2122,500
param=param_2099,0
param=param_2101,aif_dom_kendal

// 2797
[struct_2797]
param=param_2095,Draugen
param=param_2096,42
param=param_2153,npc_14458
param=param_2168,npc_14459
param=param_2123,38
param=param_2124,32
param=param_2097,3
param=param_2184,Is he a ghost? Is he the living dead? A bit of both, in fact. He lingers around the place of his death and preys upon weak travellers. He left his humanity behind in his former life so no-one should expect any favours.<br><br><col=F5B241>Quest</col>: Fremennik Trials<br><br><col=F5B241>Combat</col>: The angry viking with issues is out for your blood. Last time you had to try and hunt him down, but now he's here waiting for you! He'll attack with basic melee.
param=param_2102,Taste the wrath of the deadliest ghost in the world!
param=param_2118,vorbis_7955
param=param_2119,vorbis_7955
param=param_2120,vorbis_7955
param=param_2121,vorbis_7955
param=param_2122,600
param=param_2099,0
param=param_2101,aif_dom_draugen

// 2798
[struct_2798]
param=param_2095,Tarn Razorlor
param=param_2096,43
param=param_2153,npc_14426
param=param_2168,npc_14429
param=param_2154,npc_14428
param=param_2169,npc_14431
param=param_2155,npc_14428
param=param_2170,npc_14431
param=param_2156,npc_14428
param=param_2171,npc_14431
param=param_2157,npc_14428
param=param_2172,npc_14431
param=param_2123,37
param=param_2124,30
param=param_2125,37
param=param_2126,33
param=param_2127,39
param=param_2128,33
param=param_2129,37
param=param_2130,28
param=param_2131,39
param=param_2132,28
param=param_2097,2
param=param_2183,npc_14427
param=param_2184,Tarn ventured through Morytania in the quest for the power to control the undead but, instead, came across Treus Dayth guarding this power who proceeded to see him off. This is a man with altogether sinister intentions and is best avoided.<br><br><col=F5B241>Quest</col>: Haunted Mines<br><br><col=F5B241>Combat</col>: He'll start as a horrific mutant but in killing his first form will change to a ghost. The ghost is melee but as a mutant he will perform ranged and melee alongside summoning suits of armour to attack. How rude!
param=param_2102,Rraaaa! Pain!
param=param_2118,vorbis_8018
param=param_2119,vorbis_8018
param=param_2120,vorbis_8018
param=param_2121,vorbis_8018
param=param_2122,1600
param=param_2099,0
param=param_2101,aif_dom_tarn_razorlor

// 2799
[struct_2799]
param=param_2095,Sigmund
param=param_2096,44
param=param_2153,npc_14530
param=param_2168,npc_14531
param=param_2123,38
param=param_2124,32
param=param_2097,1
param=param_2184,This balding man is a senior member of H.A.M. and has a vicious hatred for goblins, particularly those living near his place of work at Lumbridge Castle: the Dorgeshuun. If anyone can earn the title of a 'bad guy', Sigmund can.<br><br><col=F5B241>Quest</col>: Chosen Commander<br><br><col=F5B241>Combat</col>: Seemingly to spite you as well as protect himself, Sigmund uses protection prayers against melee, ranged and magic based on how you attack him. To make things easier, you'll need to use the special attack on the ancient mace (provided in the arena) to reduce his prayer points. With the 'no specials' handicap, you'll only have a brief time to injure him before he replenishes his prayer points.
param=param_2102,We meet again!
param=param_2118,vorbis_8051
param=param_2119,vorbis_8051
param=param_2120,vorbis_8051
param=param_2121,vorbis_8051
param=param_2122,850
param=param_2099,0
param=param_2101,aif_dom_sigmund

// 2800
[struct_2800]
param=param_2095,Melzar the Mad
param=param_2096,45
param=param_2153,npc_14592
param=param_2168,npc_14593
param=param_2123,38
param=param_2124,32
param=param_2097,3
param=param_2184,Originally a citizen of Crandor, Melzar was chased away by Elvarg. In his incredibly intricate and over-engineered maze he went quite crazy. Once upon a time, he was determined to restore his former friends and allies to life after the massacre on Crandor, but he now appears to be more obsessed with cabbages.<br><br><col=F5B241>Quest</col>: Dragon Slayer<br><br><col=F5B241>Combat</col>: Surely you remember this mad geezer! In-between shouting random abuse, he'll cast a fire magic attack; 'zap' you; punch you; reduce your strength and summon cabbages.
param=param_2102,Cabbage stew!
param=param_2118,vorbis_8040
param=param_2119,vorbis_8040
param=param_2120,vorbis_8040
param=param_2121,vorbis_8040
param=param_2122,440
param=param_2099,0
param=param_2101,aif_dom_melzar

// 2801
[struct_2801]
param=param_2095,Count Draynor
param=param_2096,46
param=param_2153,npc_14495
param=param_2168,npc_14496
param=param_2123,38
param=param_2124,32
param=param_2097,1
param=param_2184,To his mates he's known as Victor (not that he probably has many). He was a follower of Zaros before he tried to kill him in an act of allegiance to Zamorak, but when Zaros was defeated he swapped back to following Zamorak. His hobbies include preying on naive travellers that visit Draynor Manor, practicing long theatrical speeches and fashion.<br><br><col=F5B241>Quest</col>: Vampyre Slayer<br><br><col=F5B241>Combat</col>: A stake through the heart, sunlight, garlic; all items on the count's least favourite list. He attacks with melee and you need to be carrying a stake and hammer (items provided in arena) when dealing the killing blow.
param=param_2102,Mmmm. I can smell your blood!
param=param_2118,vorbis_8074
param=param_2119,vorbis_8074
param=param_2120,vorbis_8074
param=param_2121,vorbis_8074
param=param_2122,500
param=param_2099,0
param=param_2101,aif_dom_count_draynor
param=param_2100,spotanim_1959

// 2802
[struct_2802]
param=param_2095,Delrith
param=param_2096,47
param=param_2153,npc_14577
param=param_2168,npc_14578
param=param_2123,37
param=param_2124,31
param=param_2097,1
param=param_2184,This demon was summoned to destroy Varrock only to be thwarted by... a talented adventurer. Not many people know that he originated in the infernal dimensions as a demon lord. Hopefully this time around any adventurer will find it easier.<br><br><col=F5B241>Quest</col>: Demon Slayer<br><br><col=F5B241>Combat</col>: A Demon with devilish melee attacks! This demon can only be banished by dealing the killing blow with Silverlight (weapon provided in arena).
param=param_2102,Grrrrr
param=param_2118,vorbis_4430
param=param_2119,vorbis_4430
param=param_2120,vorbis_4430
param=param_2121,vorbis_4430
param=param_2122,70
param=param_2099,0
param=param_2101,aif_dom_delrith

// 2803
[struct_2803]
param=param_2095,Solus Dellagar
param=param_2096,48
param=param_2153,npc_14486
param=param_2168,npc_14487
param=param_2123,38
param=param_2124,32
param=param_2097,3
param=param_2184,He may be a simple-looking mage but warriors shouldn't be fooled - he is a mass murderer and shows no sympathy for his fellow man. That, combined with the fact that there are few other mortals with his command of magic, makes him a deadly man, although hopefully not to anyone in this tower!<br><br><col=F5B241>Quest</col>: Wanted<br><br><col=F5B241>Combat</col>: Despite his classic wizard fashion style, Solus simply attacks with melee using his staff. Maybe he's feeling ill.
param=param_2102,Face the wrath of my powerful magic
param=param_2118,vorbis_8013
param=param_2119,vorbis_8013
param=param_2120,vorbis_8013
param=param_2121,vorbis_8013
param=param_2122,400
param=param_2099,0
param=param_2101,aif_dom_solus_dellagar

