param=param_1267,8
param=param_1272,1
param=param_1274,Get a ranged weapon and suitable ammunition. The combat supplier near Mj. Corothers can provide these.
param=param_1282,0_45_55_12_12
param=param_2226,1
param=param_1275,You will find your combat styles in the sidebar marked with a pair of crossed swords.
param=param_1276,Click on a style to switch to it. Different weapons have different combat styles.
param=param_1277,Cave trolls can be found in the cave north of Burthorpe. If you are low-level, bring food to eat!
param=param_1285,0_99_99_1_3
param=param_2225,There are benefits to each fighting style. For fastest training, use the rapid style unless you're having trouble hitting your opponent.

// 7028
[struct_7028]
param=param_1266,Adventurer's Log
param=param_1273,Cut a log from a regular tree so you have some wood to work with.
param=param_1271,"aif_omge_quest_icons_01,17"
param=param_1268,412
param=param_1267,8
param=param_1274,Find any regular <col=FFFFFF>tree</col> and click it to start chopping.
param=param_1282,0_45_54_34_14
param=param_2226,1
param=param_2225,Cutting a log from a tree earns you Woodcutting XP. The logs you gather can be used to train Firemaking or Fletching. You might want to gather a few more.
param=param_1272,1

// 7029
[struct_7029]
param=param_1266,Lighter Log
param=param_1273,Set fire to a regular log to save space and earn Firemaking XP.
param=param_1271,"aif_omge_quest_icons_01,16"
param=param_1268,413
param=param_1267,8
param=param_1274,If you need more logs, you can chop down some trees.
param=param_1282,0_45_54_34_14
param=param_1275,<col=FFFFFF>Left-click</col> a <col=FFFFFF>log</col> in your <col=FFFFFF>inventory</col> and click the <col=FFFFFF>tinderbox</col> option in the bottom left of the screen.
param=param_1283,0_99_99_1_31
param=param_1276,Make sure there's room under your feet to set the logs down. Don't stand on anything.
param=param_1277,If clicking a log brings up fletching options, click the back arrow in the top left of the skilling interface.
param=param_2226,2
