param=param_1283,0_99_99_1_31
param=param_1276,Sometimes when cooking, you will burn the food. Make sure you bring plenty. You can catch more crayfish at a fishing spot.
param=param_1284,0_45_54_19_13
param=param_2226,2
param=param_2225,Cooking food gives Cooking XP and makes food you can eat to heal. Burned food doesn't give XP and can't be eaten. Most players just drop it on the floor.<br><br>Most raw meat and fish and some more unusual things can be cooked.
