param=param_1267,8
param=param_1272,1
param=param_1274,<col=FFFFFF>Right-click</col> any tutor (the characters with round icons over their heads) and select <col=FFFFFF>trade</col>.
param=param_1282,0_45_53_16_50
param=param_2226,1
param=param_1275,You can sell things to the shop by <col=FFFFFF>right-clicking</col> them in your inventory and choosing how many to sell.
param=param_1283,0_99_99_1_32
param=param_1276,Close the shop when you're done.
param=param_1284,0_99_99_1_33
param=param_2225,Selling unwanted goods to a shop is a quick way of turning them into money. Some shops won't buy all items because they specialise in a certain item type.

