param=param_1275,- Each essence has a 10% chance of gaining a second blood rune at the Blood altar.
param=param_1276,- 50% more Prayer XP from burning vyrewatch.
param=param_1277,- 20% chance of creating a 4-dose prayer renewal potion when making it in Morytania.
param=param_1278,- 10% additional Slayer XP for kills in the Slayer Tower when on a task.
param=param_1279,- Double mushroom yield on the patch near Canifis.
